{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, approach it, take it, check it, do specific task, move, otherwise scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperty    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTaskSubtree    />\"",
